text:
Leading blockbuster deals, @thales is poised to acquire @Exail_ for more than $4 billion. Thales would expand into several markets with the purchase, including underwater warfare.

Here are the stories we're following on this edition of Photonics Spectra Now:

@fusionbionicgmbh raises more than $9 million for its work in surface functionalization.
Research from a group led by @KEEQuant shows that the same fiber that connects your home's internet, could also connect you to #quantum  systems.
@CERN is shutting down the #largehadroncollider for an upgrade and a light boost.
Among moves to advance smart contact lenses, @xpanceo is building on its partnership with JBD to bring #augmentedreality to your lens, and #AzaleaVision is awarded EIC funding for clinical development.
And @SPIETV has opened the window for applications for the 2027 SPIE Prism Awards!

Photonics Spectra Now would like to thank its sponsor:
@lightpathtech - www.lightpath.com

